    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:b9ad3e14216c2f08",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "7fd57d5743cee0f7661e32453495cad6b24838c868f78b641ddcbd1b392a6923",
      "text": "Transfer and ferry to San Jorge Port. Then, we will visit Mombacho Volcano. On this tour you will be able to see the beauty of the nature and feel the adrenaline from the zip line adventure. Once here, we will switch from your regular vehicle to a 4x4 and drive all the way to the top of the volcano. After driving half an hour, we are ready to walk around one of the dormant crater of Mombacho Volcano, and enjoy the breathtaking views that overlook Lake Nicaragua, the city of Granada and the Islets of Granada. After hiking around this cloud forest, we will drive back to Hacienda El Progreso, the place where we gear up and fly above the trees, for an incredible experience. Transfer to San Juan del Sur. Overnight at Hotel Alcazar. (Meals: B)",
